## Data Store Strategy

| Data | Store | Reason |
|------|-------|--------|
| Users, Tenants, Roles | BoltDB | Embedded, no schema, fast |
| Agents, Tools | BoltDB | Embedded, tenant-scoped |
| Audit Events | BoltDB | Embedded, retention policy |
| Refresh Tokens | BoltDB | Embedded, TTL |
| Events (Product) | PostgreSQL | Scalable, queryable |
| Projects, API Keys | PostgreSQL | Relational, foreign keys |

